## Tool versions and updates

Development tools are pinned in `package.json` to versions tested with these
configurations. Run them through the project scripts so local and CI checks
use the same tools.

`.womm-template.json` records the generator, template version and original
choices. It is provenance, not a list of the tools currently installed.

To upgrade a tool, change its dependency pin and review its release notes for
configuration changes. Run `{{ package_manager }} install` to update the lockfile.
{% if tooling == "biome" %}Update the `$schema` version in `biome.json` along with the Biome dependency.
Run the installed Biome's `migrate` command to preview required migrations
before applying them with `--write`.
{% endif %}Run all quality, test and build checks before committing the updated
configuration and lockfile. Upgrading WOMM does not update this project's files.

